     *  3. Re-compute the exact cost with the updated rates and the provider
     *     off-peak multiplier (if applicable), then round to 6 digits
     *     HALF_UP — identical to the original rating path.
     *  4. Update the event row in place; accumulate the signed delta
     *     Σ(new_rounded − old_rounded) for the stdout report.
     *
     * @return RepriceSummary
